# Unfree DisplayLink driver blob (Elgato Prompter, see nixos/lib/displaylink.nix).
# EULA-gated, so it can't be fetched by Nix -- it has to be downloaded by hand
# and added to the store with `nix-store --add-fixed sha256`. Kept out of git,
# but worth keeping on disk: if the store path is ever garbage-collected, the
# rebuild fails until it's re-added.
DisplayLink*.zip
displaylink-*.zip
